WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:05.650
I served in the United States Marine Corps
for four and half years. I found Hillsdale

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.240
at the end of my last deployment, applied
and I came here basically three weeks later.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.570
Hillsdale stood out from the other colleges
that I was looking at, in that it emphasized

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.020
teaching you how to learn, not what to think.
And, so I felt like I could take that and

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.930
kind of become a learner for the rest of my
life, rather than just learning for four years.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:31.830
Once I decided to come to Hillsdale the big
flashing question was, what about financial

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:38.620
aid? I was just so impressed with how eager
they were to help me get here. Private donors

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:43.760
had stepped in and ended up providing basically
a full ride for me, a full four years here

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.829
at Hillsdale. And it's amazing to see that
because they understand how valuable this

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:48.430
is.

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:54.500
I think for most of the people coming from
the military, they already have this deep

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:59.300
sense of love and respect for our country.
But there's a lot of room for understand what

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:04.320
that country is. And, the things that really
established it and have preserved it. The

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:10.530
liberal arts and education here will not only
give you that but so much more. This foundation

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:14.770
not just for government and how we live in
society together, but in your own life an

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:21.420
understanding of what it means to be human.
And how to live the best life. You'll be able

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:25.690
to apply that and take that to whatever career
path, wherever it is go, whatever it is you

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:30.250
want to do, that's going to form every aspect
of your life.

